okf_version: "1.0"
task: "Widen the workspace router port range to about 50."
reported: "User, 2026-09-23, launching from F:\greenland: 'RuntimeError: no free ciel-runtime router port found in 9464-9495' / '포트 레인지를 좀더 크게 50개정도 확보'"
observed:
  listening: "Only 6 ports in 9464-9520 were listening (9465, 9467 tailscaled, 9469, 9485, 9489, 9493)."
  registry: "%APPDATA%\ciel-runtime\workspace-router-ports.json held 42 workspace reservations, covering every port 9464-9495 (many temp/test folders: .tmp\npm-nightly-smoke, AppData\Local\Temp\..., ciel-runtime\tests, c:\windows\temp). _select_port skips reserved ports even when nothing listens, and reservations are never released, so the range fills with reservations."
change: "workspace_router_selection.ROUTER_PORT_SCAN_SIZE = 50 (was the literal default 32): range 9464-9513. The only derived port, the Codex app-server at router+20, already overlapped the router range at 32, so this adds no new kind of collision."
tests: "New test: 32 reserved ports -> a new workspace gets 9496; the error names 9464-9513. unit 1608 OK (skipped=45), router 1154 OK, channel 434 OK (skipped=80), runtime 320 OK (skipped=19); ruff clean."
real_check: "On a copy of the live registry with real health/port probes, F:/greenland selects 9496. The live registry was not modified."
not_done:
  - "Deployment recorded below."
  - "Reservation release (stale temp/test workspaces) not changed; not instructed."
deployment:
  commits: "b364151 journal [skip ci]; ae32250 fix(router): widen the workspace router port range to 50"
  nightly: "origin/nightly 130a154 -> ae32250 (main not pushed). CI 35939038937 success; Publish to npm 35939039105 success; published 0.2.51-nightly.20260924-003723.ae32250 (gitHead ae32250); npm i -g @nightly installed it, ROUTER_PORT_SCAN_SIZE = 50 in the installed tree."
  local: "Snapshot C:\Users\djlov\.local\share\ciel-runtime-ae32250e99d47a47d9c288ad9b01dd381b125e2c via install.ps1; CIEL_RUNTIME_HOME (User) pinned to it; sha256 of ciel_runtime.py, workspace_router_selection.py, channel_pending_poll.py match the repo. The snapshot's code on a copy of the live registry selects 9496 for F:/greenland."
